18:T462,Discover Singapore's vibrant fusion of cultures, iconic sightseeing and unforgettable cuisine in signature luxury at JEN Singapore Tanglin by Shangri-La, a playful property ranked in the top 10% of hotels worldwide by Tripadvisor. Singapore is renowned for its cuisine, from street food hawker fare in Chinatown to Michelin-starred fine dining. Here, you can enjoy an authentic, mouthwatering feast without leaving your hotel. J65 serves up hot, home-style dishes alongside fresh seafood, Ah Hoi's Kitchen is all about authentic Singaporean cuisine and Rumpoles Bar is your go-to for a Singapore-inspired craft cocktail in an exclusive club-like setting. When you're not wining and dining, make use of the hotel's 24-hour gym or take a dip in the outdoor swimming pool and whirlpool. When you’re ready to explore the wonders Singapore has to offer, Orchard Road's retail heaven is just a short walk away, while the open-air food street of Chinatown, where you'll find your next great feed, is a 10-minute drive. Slightly further are the jaw-dropping garden displays of the iconic Gardens by the Bay and Marina Bay Sands.14:["$","div",null,{"className":"main-content","children":["$","$L17",null,{"hotels":[{"vendor_name":"Jen Singapore Tanglin","offer_country_name":"Singapore","location_heading":"Tanglin","title":"Top-Rated Singapore Escape near Orchard Road with Two Onsite Restaurants & Bar","description":"$18","location_subheading":"Singapore","price":127,"original_price":127,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000006zXGTAA2","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/b7nhyral4nkxczom6iwv","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/9ozhb7htp1blorxzgxi","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/72f07ee5mwd0e4yurtw","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 1","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}]}]
